This repository consolidates the following implementations at these source
revisions:

- pusht-jax: 74f4285 (Apache-2.0)
- tworooms-jax: 60e74a0 (Apache-2.0)
- reacher-mjx: 3cd65fa (MIT)
- OGBench Cube MJX fork: 6bd3daf (MIT)

PushT compatibility is based on Diffusion Policy and Hugging Face gym-pusht.
Two-Room compatibility is based on Stable World Models and PLDM/EB-JEPA.
Reacher loads its model and task constants from DeepMind Control Suite.
Cube includes the minimal OGBench model builder and required robot assets.

Full third-party notices and license texts are in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md and
the LICENSE files retained beside the vendored robot assets.
